title: Case Manager › Sites › What each site sees and out-of-site links
route: /manager
intro: Every case belongs to one site, the same site on every screen. The tracker, its tiles and filters, the header counts, 'Being prepared', the step-down plans, the reviews and the sidebar bubble all follow the site view. A viewer limited to one site never sees, counts, drafts or signs the other site's cases, and a direct link to one shows an out-of-site card. Totals for Both sites equal Site A plus Site B.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Switch the site in the top bar: Both sites, Site A or Site B\nOr Demo menu, 'Viewing as': Dr. Rivera (Site A only), Sam Okafor (Site B only)"
screen sc1 "Case Manager follows the view\nHeader count and a small 'Site A' tag after it when the view is narrowed\nTracker rows, the four status tiles, the 'Being prepared' row, 'Step-down plans'\nReviews tab: header count, the three tiles, the day cards, 'Ready to step down?'"
process p1 "Both sites: 56 active cases = Site A 33 plus Site B 23\nBeing prepared: 5 = 4 plus 1\nReviews due this week: 47 = 27 plus 20\nThe four tiles add up the same way"
process p2 "Sidebar bubble on 'Case Manager' = cases that need a person (Being prepared) plus reviews that need a clinician's update, at the sites in view\nBoth sites 11 = Site A 6 plus Site B 5"
decision d1 "Is the viewer limited to one site?"
process p3 "The other site's cases do not exist for the viewer: not in the tracker, not found by the search, not counted"
process p4 "A viewer of both sites narrows to one site and widens again; every number on the page changes at once"
process p5 "'Draft all due reviews' and 'Sign all clean drafts' act only on reviews at the sites in view\nThe toast counts only those"
process p6 "A step-down plan from an accepted denial is shown at the denial's site"

start s2 "Open a link to a case\n/authorizations/case/ID from the tracker, a review's 'Open case', a notification or a bookmark"
decision d2 "Is the case at a site in view?"
screen ok "The case page opens as usual\n(Authorizations case page, or the Ledger case page)"
screen o1 "Out-of-site card instead of the page\n'This case is not available at Site A'\nNames the site that has it, no patient or detail"
decision d3 "Can the viewer see both sites?"
click c1 "Click 'Show Site B'"
process p7 "The view widens to that site and the case opens"
click c2 "Click 'Back to the Dashboard'"
goto g1 "Continues in: Dashboard › Arrive › What the page shows"
endx e1 "A viewer limited to one site has no way to the other site's case"
goto g2 "Continues in: Case Manager › Active cases › Tracker of every active case"
goto g3 "Continues in: Case Manager › Reviews this week › Draft all due reviews and sign all clean drafts"

s1 --> sc1 --> p1
sc1 --> p2
sc1 --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| p3
d1 -->|No| p4
sc1 -.-> p5 --> g3
sc1 -.-> p6
sc1 --> g2
s2 --> d2
d2 -->|Yes| ok
d2 -->|No| o1 --> d3
d3 -->|Yes| c1 --> p7 --> ok
d3 -->|No| e1
o1 --> c2 --> g1
